<title>USA: Legg Mason Wood Walker names Robert Frank Exec VP.</title>
<headline>Legg Mason Wood Walker names Robert Frank Exec VP.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc said on Tuesday it appointed Robert Frank as executive vice president, director of research and co-head of its Capital Markets Division.</p>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc is the principal broker-dealer subsidiary of Legg Mason Inc.</p>
<p>Frank previously spent 21 years at Alex. Brown Inc, where he was a managing director and head of the Real Estate Securities Research Group, a statement from Legg Mason said.</p>
